<section class="sbs-panel" data-panel="mockups" id="sbs-mockups" aria-labelledby="sbs-mu-title">
 <h1 id="sbs-mu-title" tabindex="-1">Mock-ups</h1>
 <div class="sbs-mu-controls">
  <button type="button" class="sbs-button sbs-mu-template" id="sbs-mu-choose"><img id="sbs-mu-thumb" alt="Selected reusable photo" hidden><span id="sbs-mu-template-label">Choose template</span></button>
  <div><label for="sbs-mu-search">Search artwork</label><div class="sbs-mu-row"><input id="sbs-mu-search" type="search" placeholder="Try tail or muscle"><button type="button" id="sbs-mu-clear" class="sbs-button">Clear</button></div><label for="sbs-mu-artwork">Approved Studio artwork</label><select id="sbs-mu-artwork"><option value="">Choose artwork</option></select><p id="sbs-mu-matches" role="status"></p></div>
  <label class="sbs-mu-file">Browse tablet artwork<input type="file" id="sbs-mu-art-file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp"></label>
  <div><button type="button" id="sbs-mu-colour-button" class="sbs-button" popovertarget="sbs-mu-colours">Shirt: White</button><div id="sbs-mu-colours" popover aria-label="Approximate Redbubble shirt colours"><p>Screenshot-sampled references; names and colours are approximate. Original fabric shading is retained.</p><div id="sbs-mu-swatches"></div></div></div>
  <div><label for="sbs-mu-ratio">Crop / output ratio</label><div class="sbs-mu-row"><select id="sbs-mu-ratio"><option value="original">Original — uncropped</option><option value="1">1:1 — Instagram / Facebook squares</option><option value="0.8">4:5 — Instagram / Facebook portrait</option><option value="0.75">3:4 — Instagram taller portrait</option><option value="0.6666666667">2:3 — Pinterest</option><option value="0.5625">9:16 — Stories / Reels covers / TikTok</option><option value="1.7777777778">16:9 — YouTube / web landscape</option><option value="1.91">1.91:1 — Facebook / LinkedIn wide</option><option value="1.3333333333">4:3 — website / blog</option></select><button type="button" id="sbs-mu-ratio-info" class="sbs-button sbs-mu-info" aria-label="About crop ratios">i</button></div></div>
  <div><label for="sbs-mu-expand">Expansion</label><div class="sbs-mu-row"><select id="sbs-mu-expand"><option value="none">Do nothing</option><option value="smart">Smart expand — top, bottom and sides</option><option value="scene">Full scene outpaint — Advanced</option></select><button type="button" id="sbs-mu-expand-info" class="sbs-button sbs-mu-info" aria-label="About expansion modes and anchors">i</button></div></div>
 </div>
 <div id="sbs-mu-anchors-box" hidden><div id="sbs-mu-anchors" role="group" aria-label="Expanded image anchor"></div><p id="sbs-mu-anchor-label" role="status">Anchor: Centre</p></div>
 <div class="sbs-mu-row"><button type="button" class="sbs-button" id="sbs-mu-move" aria-pressed="true">Move artwork</button><button type="button" class="sbs-button" id="sbs-mu-crop-tool" aria-pressed="false">Adjust crop frame</button><button type="button" class="sbs-button" id="sbs-mu-fit">Fit full shirt / graphic</button></div>
 <p id="sbs-mu-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Choose a reusable white-shirt photo, then artwork. Drag the graphic; use a corner to resize.</p>
 <div class="sbs-mu-preview"><canvas id="sbs-mu-canvas" width="1000" height="800" aria-label="Mock-up preview — drag artwork or resize at its corners"></canvas></div>
 <div class="sbs-mu-finish"><button type="button" id="sbs-mu-finish" class="sbs-button primary">Finish &amp; Check</button><button type="button" id="sbs-mu-download" class="sbs-button primary">Download</button></div>
 <p id="sbs-mu-download-status" role="status">Download is your choice. Checks and warnings never lock it.</p>
 <div id="sbs-mu-qa" role="status" aria-live="polite">NOT CHECKED — web mock-up only; no production approval.</div><div id="sbs-mu-findings"></div>
 <details id="sbs-mu-advanced"><summary>Advanced</summary><div class="sbs-mu-controls">
  <button type="button" id="sbs-mu-calibrate" class="sbs-button">Edit this template’s shirt mask / print area</button>
  <label>Initial print-area reference<select id="sbs-mu-print-class"><option value="standard">Redbubble Standard — approximate</option><option value="premium">Redbubble Premium — approximate</option><option value="manual">Manual photo calibration</option></select></label><button type="button" id="sbs-mu-fit-art" class="sbs-button">Fit artwork to print area</button>
  <label>Crop fit<select id="sbs-mu-fit-mode"><option value="crop">Adjust crop frame</option><option value="pad">Fit full photo — pad if needed</option></select></label>
  <label>Custom ratio width<input id="sbs-mu-custom-w" type="number" min="1" max="100" value="1"></label><label>Custom ratio height<input id="sbs-mu-custom-h" type="number" min="1" max="100" value="1"></label><button id="sbs-mu-custom" type="button" class="sbs-button">Use custom ratio</button>
  <label>Web format<select id="sbs-mu-format"><option value="image/jpeg">JPEG</option><option value="image/png">PNG</option><option value="image/webp">WebP</option></select></label><label>Long edge, pixels<input id="sbs-mu-output" type="number" min="320" max="3000" step="1" value="1920"></label>
  <label>Scene continuation instructions<textarea id="sbs-mu-instructions" rows="2" maxlength="1000" placeholder="Optional background or scene details"></textarea></label><button id="sbs-mu-resume" type="button" class="sbs-button" hidden>Resume existing expansion</button><button id="sbs-mu-restart" type="button" class="sbs-button" hidden>Start a different expansion request</button>
 </div><p>Sizes and shirt colours are visual estimates, not verified supplier fabric or physical placement. AI expansion uses provider credits only when you intentionally press Finish &amp; Check in an expansion mode. “Do nothing” uses no AI. Original photos and print masters remain unchanged. Generated outer areas require your visual review; shirt-only recolouring follows the saved mask.</p></details>
 <dialog id="sbs-mu-gallery" aria-labelledby="sbs-mu-gallery-title"><h2 id="sbs-mu-gallery-title">Choose a photo template</h2><div class="sbs-mu-row"><label>Add white-shirt photo<input id="sbs-mu-template-file" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp"></label><button id="sbs-mu-gallery-close" type="button" class="sbs-button">Close</button></div><div id="sbs-mu-gallery-grid"></div><button id="sbs-mu-more" type="button" class="sbs-button" hidden>Show more photos</button><p id="sbs-mu-gallery-status" role="status"></p></dialog>
 <dialog id="sbs-mu-cal-dialog" aria-labelledby="sbs-mu-cal-title"><h2 id="sbs-mu-cal-title">Check this photo once, reuse it later</h2><p>Gold overlay = shirt-only mask. Paint missed fabric; erase skin, hair, hands and background. Under Print corners, drag the four numbered corners around the usable chest print area. Detection is a suggestion and may include background.</p><div class="sbs-mu-controls"><label>Template name<input id="sbs-mu-cal-name" maxlength="180"></label><label>Source / licence note — optional<input id="sbs-mu-cal-note" maxlength="1000"></label><label>Tool<select id="sbs-mu-cal-tool"><option value="paint">Paint shirt mask</option><option value="erase">Erase mask / occlusion</option><option value="seed">Detect connected white shirt — tap fabric</option><option value="corners">Print corners / perspective</option></select></label><label>Brush size<select id="sbs-mu-brush"><option value=".008">Fine</option><option value=".02" selected>Medium</option><option value=".05">Large</option></select></label><button id="sbs-mu-mask-clear" type="button" class="sbs-button">Clear mask</button></div><canvas id="sbs-mu-cal-canvas" width="1000" height="800" aria-label="Editable shirt mask and four print-area corners"></canvas><label><input id="sbs-mu-cal-review" type="checkbox"> I checked the shirt-only mask, occlusions and print corners.</label><div class="sbs-mu-row"><button id="sbs-mu-cal-save" type="button" class="sbs-button primary">Save reusable template</button><button id="sbs-mu-cal-cancel" type="button" class="sbs-button">Cancel</button></div><p id="sbs-mu-cal-status" role="status"></p></dialog>
 <dialog id="sbs-mu-info-dialog" aria-labelledby="sbs-mu-info-title"><h2 id="sbs-mu-info-title">Mock-up help</h2><div id="sbs-mu-info-text"></div><button type="button" id="sbs-mu-info-close" class="sbs-button">Close</button></dialog>
</section>
